    python_version; torch.__config__.show() for the compiler; torch.version for
    the accelerator; torch.backends.cpu.get_cpu_capability() plus the AMX probe;
    torch.accelerator.device_count(); NVML, amdsmi, xpu-smi or sysctl for the
    device model, normalized by normalize_device_name(), and empty when
    device_count is 0.
  flag: every setting the harness registers for repro (TestEnvironment
    .env_var_values), with the value in effect: 1 or 0 for flags, implied ones
    included, the setting's value otherwise and empty when unset; sorted by
    name; tests.environments.flags.
  -->
