  <!--
  What: one execution of one test, one row of tests.runs, in execution order.
    file, suite, case_name: tests.tests identity (section 4.1), taken from the
      pytest node id: the launched file as a rootdir-relative path, the
      innermost class, and the test name with its parameters. For pytest-cpp
      items the file is the binary as run_test.py names it (cpp/test_api), the
      suite and case_name the gtest suite and test.
    rerun_number: 0 for the test's first execution in this process, then 1, 2,
      ... for pytest-rerunfailures reruns and flakefinder repeats.
    outcome: passed, failed, error, skipped, xfailed, xpassed (appendix B);
